-- Never-existed keys. The predicate crossing reports over X, so the Flag-excluded row 3 is
-- still reported; the effect crossing reports over S, so row 3 is not. The live link still
-- delivers its value and the dead one simply drops.
--! registry dead-key-world
--! expect gold = 5 5 3 7

Flag & mentor.Dead , Gold += 1
Flag , Gold = mentor.Gold
